    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><strong>Contract:</strong> <em>No One Left Behind.</em></p><p>Once per scene, when an ally would fall, you may:</p><ul><li><p>Redirect some harm to yourself,</p></li><li><p>Stabilize them immediately,</p></li><li><p>Grant protected withdrawal without pursuit.</p></li></ul><p>This is not dominance.<br />It is shared burden.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1 Surge to amplify (increase stabilization or protection value).</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Repeated magical rescues may reduce community autonomy over time.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
